      "message": "I can make this change in `ec_cmd_api.h`\n```\ndiff --git a/include/ec_cmd_api.h b/include/ec_cmd_api.h\nindex cb1522aea6..b01ca43c14 100644\n--- a/include/ec_cmd_api.h\n+++ b/include/ec_cmd_api.h\n@@ -306,7 +306,7 @@ _CROS_EC_C0_F_PF_RF(EC_CMD_FP_READ_MATCH_SECRET, fp_read_match_secret);\n\n-_CROS_EC_CV_F_R(EC_CMD_FP_INFO, 1, fp_info, fp_info);\n+_CROS_EC_CV_F_R(EC_CMD_FP_INFO, 2, fp_info, fp_info_v2);\n```\nwhich will expand to the following:\n\n```\nstatic inline int ec_cmd_fp_info(CROS_EC_COMMAND_INFO *h,\n\t\t\t\t struct ec_response_fp_info_v2 *r)\n{\n\treturn CROS_EC_COMMAND(h, (EC_CMD_FP_INFO), (2), NULL, 0, r,\n\t\t\t       sizeof(*r));\n}\n```\n\nI can now try to use the modified `ec_cmd_fp_info` macro inside `zephyr/test/fingerprint/task/src/fpsensor_init.cc`\n\n```\ndiff --git a/zephyr/test/fingerprint/task/src/fpsensor_init.cc b/zephyr/test/fingerprint/task/src/fpsensor_init.cc\nindex f529fe286a..9d8c7f294f 100644\n--- a/zephyr/test/fingerprint/task/src/fpsensor_init.cc\n+++ b/zephyr/test/fingerprint/task/src/fpsensor_init.cc\n@@ -127,7 +127,7 @@ ZTEST_USER(fpsensor_init, test_maintenance_mode_dead_pixel_3)\n        const int dead_pixels \u003d 3;\n \n        /* Confirm that number of dead pixels is unknown. */\n-       zassert_ok(fpinfo_cmd_helper(test_info_buffer));\n+       zassert_ok(ec_cmd_fp_info(NULL, test_info_buffer));\n        zassert_equal(\n                FP_ERROR_DEAD_PIXELS(test_info_buffer-\u003esensor_info.errors),\n                FP_ERROR_DEAD_PIXELS_UNKNOWN);\n@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@ ZTEST_USER(fpsensor_init, test_maintenance_mode_dead_pixel_3)\n        zassert_true(state.maintenance_ran);\n \n        /* Confirm that number of dead pixels is correct. */\n-       zassert_ok(fpinfo_cmd_helper(test_info_buffer));\n+       zassert_ok(ec_cmd_fp_info(NULL, test_info_buffer));\n        zassert_equal(\n                FP_ERROR_DEAD_PIXELS(test_info_buffer-\u003esensor_info.errors),\n                dead_pixels);\n@@ -186,7 +186,